ction.</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></section><section class=\"w-full relative text-primary5\" id=\"contactUs\"><div class=\"p-[3em] bg-primary1\"><header><h3 class=\"font-h1 pb-[1em]\">CTA</h3></header><p class=\"font-b1\"></p></div></section><footer class=\"w-full relative text-primary1 font-b1\"><div class=\"p-[3em] bg-primary5\"><div class=\"flex justify-evenly\"><div>Quick Links :<ul><li class=\"\"><a href=\"/#home\">Home</a></li><li class=\"ml-[1em]\"><a href=\"/#aboutUs\">About Us</a></li><li class=\"ml-[1em]\"><a href=\"/#featuredProduct\">Featured Product</a></li><li class=\"ml-[1em]\"><a href=\"/#howToOrder\">How To Order</a></li><li class=\"ml-[1em]\"><a href=\"/#contactUs\">Contact Us</a></li><li class=\"\"><a href=\"/catalog\">Our Product</a></li></ul></div><div>Contact Information :<ul><li class=\"\">Phone: (+62) 811 168 8994</li><li class=\"\">Email: wilnwinputraindo@gmail.com</li></ul></div><div>Follow Us :<ul></ul></div><div>Legal Information :<ul><li class=\"\">Privacy Policy</li><li class=\"\">Terms of Service</li></ul></div><div>Newsletter Signup :<ul><li class=\"\">Subscribe</li></ul></div></div><div class=\"w-full text-center\">© 2025 WilNWin Furniture. All Rights Reserved.</div></div></footer><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/webpack-c314bb12a3a94cd4.js\" async=\"\"></script><script>(self.__next_f=self.__next_f||[]).push([0])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"1:\\\"$Sreact.fragment\\\"\\n2:I[5244,[],\\\"\\\"]\\n3:I[3866,[],\\\"\\\"]\\n4:I[8173,[\\\"173\\\",\\\"static/chunks/173-fc558b54b5be890b.js\\\",\\\"970\\\",\\\"static/chunks/970-273da32e793c59cb.js\\\",\\\"813\\\",\\\"static/chunks/app/(home)/page-592057b02af7aa02.js\\\"],\\\"\\\"]\\nb:I[6213,[],\\\"OutletBoundary\\\"]\\nd:I[6213,[],\\\"MetadataBoundary\\\"]\\nf:I[6213,[],\\\"ViewportBoundary\\\"]\\n11:I[4835,[],\\\"\\\"]\\n:HL[\\\"/_next/static/media/031744d8c530b256-s.p.ttf\\\",\\\"font\\\",{\\\"crossOrigin\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"font/ttf\\\"}]\\n:HL[\\\"/_next/st